olates LaTeX math boundaries, indexes uncited claims across arXiv, Semantic Scholar, and OpenAlex, and detects retraction traps before peer review.\"/><meta name=\"author\" content=\"ReciteAI Engineering\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"manuscript verification,citation auditor,LaTeX parser,scientific publishing,Zotero sync,OpenAlex,arXiv preprints,peer review defense\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"__variable_f367f3 __variable_3c557b bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-100 font-sans antialiased flex flex-col h-screen overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 font-sans transition-colors\"><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-30 bg-white/80 dark:bg-zinc-900/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 h-14 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-900 dark:hover:text-zinc-100 hover:bg-zinc-100 dark:hover:bg-zinc-800 transition-colors\" href=\"/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-left\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"></path></svg><span>Back to Workbench</span></a><span class=\"text-zinc-300 dark:text-zinc-700\">/</span><h1 class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Account &amp; Preferences</h1></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"></div></div></header><main class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 space-y-8\"><section class=\"bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-black/5 dark:ring-white/10 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800 pb-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user text-zinc-500\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><span>Identity &amp; Access</span></h2><p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Manage your authenticated researcher profile and linked identity providers.</p></div></div><div class=\"py-8 flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-zinc-400\">Loading researcher profile...</div></section><section class=\"bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-black/5 dark:ring-white/10 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800 pb-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-credit-card text-zinc-500\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"14\" x=\"2\" y=\"5\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"22\" y1=\"10\" y2=\"10\"></line></svg><span>Billing &amp; Audit Credits</span></h2><p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Track your active pre-flight allowance and semantic verification entitlements.</p></div><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700\"><span>Free Pre-Flight</span></span></div><div class=\"space-y-5\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300\"><span>Monthly Audit Credits</span><span class=\"font-mono\">3<!-- --> of <!-- -->10<!-- --> credits used</span></div><div class=\"w-full h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full bg-emerald-500 rounded-full transition-all duration-300\" style=\"width:30%\"></div></div><p class=\"text-[11px] text-zinc-500\">Each deep semantic claim verification consumes 1 credit. Local AST checks remain unlimited.</p></div><div class=\"p-5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-50 to-emerald-50/40 dark:from-zinc-900 dark:to-emerald-950/20 border border-emerald-500/20 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><div class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 flex items-center gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap text-emerald-500\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg><span>Upgrade to Researcher Pro</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 max-w-md\">Unlock unlimited pre-submission audits, missing baseline detection, and institutional PDF verification for $49/year.</p></div><a class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white font-medium text-xs rounded-xl transition-colors shadow-sm shrink-0 flex items-center gap-1.5\" href=\"/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg><span>Get Researcher Pro</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 rounded-2xl ring-1 ring-black/5 dark:ring-white/10 shadow-sm p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800 pb-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sliders-vertical text-zinc-500\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"4\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"4\" y1=\"10\" y2=\"3\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"3\"></line><line x1=\"20\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"20\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"14\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"18\" x2=\"22\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><span>Workspace Preferences</span></h2><p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Configure local AST processing, citation standards, and verification thresholds.</p></div></div><div class=\"space-y-6 divide-y divide-zinc-100 dark:divide-zinc-800 text-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 pt-4 first:pt-0\"><div class=\"space-y-1 max-w-lg\"><label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 block\">Local Processing</label><p class=\"text-zinc-500\">Parse LaTeX AST trees, math equations, and bibliography keys locally in your browser memory for air-gapped security and zero-latency performance.</p></div><button type=\"button\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-6 w-11 shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-full border-2 border-transparent transition-colors duration-200 ease-in-out focus:outline-none bg-emerald-500\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none inline-block h-5 w-5 transform rounded-full bg-white shadow ring-0 transition duration-200 ease-in-out translate-x-5\"></span></button></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 block\">Default Citation Format</label><p class=\"text-zinc-500\">Standard format applied when inserting references into manuscript files.</p></div><select class=\"w-full sm:w-48 bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 rounded-xl px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500/40\"><option value=\"apa\" selected=\"\">APA 7th Edition</option><option value=\"ieee\">IEEE</option><option value=\"chicago\">Chicago 17th Edition</option><option value=\"nature\">Nature / Vancouver</option><option value=\"acm\">ACM Reference Format</option></select></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 block\">Audit Verification Rigor</label><p class=\"text-zinc-500\">Configure confidence threshold for flagging attribution gaps.</p></div><select class=\"w-full sm:w-48 bg-zinc-50 dark:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 rounded-xl px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500/40\"><option value=\"standard\" selected=\"\">Standard (Balanced)</option><option value=\"high\">High Rigor (Peer Review)</option><option value=\"conservative\">Strict (0% Tolerance)</option></select></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 pt-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1 max-w-lg\"><label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 block\">Audit Export Dossier Sharing</label><p class=\"text-zinc-500\">Include pre-formatted summary text for co-authors and Principal Investigators when generating dossiers.</p></div><button type=\"button\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\" class=\"relative inline-flex h-6 w-11 shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-full border-2 border-transparent transition-colors duration-200 ease-in-out focus:outline-none bg-emerald-500\"><span class=\"pointer-events-none inline-block h-5 w-5 transform rounded-full bg-white shadow ring-0 transition duration-200 ease-in-out translate-x-5\"></span></button></div></div><div class=\"pt-4 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800 flex justify-end\"><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-100 hover:bg-zinc-800 dark:hover:bg-white text-white dark:text-zinc-900 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors shadow-sm cursor-pointer\">Save Preferences</button></div></section></main></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-8fddb7fa8525dc98.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[4086,[\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-d4888928c0fa9818.js\\\"],\\\"GlobalErrorBoundary\\\"]\\n3:I[5244,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[3866,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n5:I[8173,[\\\"8173\\\",\\\"static/chunks/8173-dd7652b225487f6d.js\\\",\\\"4345\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/not-found-5207509e3c343c4e.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[7033,[],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\n7:I[5227,[\\\"7330\\\",\\\"static/chunks/d3ac728e-3c47e6b3978342d6.js\\\",\\\"9268\\\",\\\"static/chunks/aaea2bcf-ea47c9d17a1617cb.js\\\",\\\"5185\\\",\\\"static/chunks/5185-128a8b3a2898a5c7.js\\\",\\\"8173\\\",\\\"s